## 👨‍💻 About Me

I am a DevOps enthusiast focused on cloud infrastructure, automation, and modern software delivery practices.

Currently building hands-on skills in Linux, Git, Docker, Kubernetes, Jenkins, and Terraform while learning how scalable and reliable systems are designed and deployed in real-world environments.

**What I am currently working on:**
- Building CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins and GitHub
- Containerizing applications using Docker
- Learning Kubernetes for container orchestration
- Practicing Infrastructure as Code using Terraform
- Exploring AWS cloud services for scalable deployments

I actively document my DevOps learning journey through detailed technical notes, practical experiments, and hands-on projects.

**Technologies I work with:**

Linux | AWS | Docker | Kubernetes | Terraform | Jenkins | Git | Bash | Python

My goal is to become a DevOps / Cloud Engineer who can design reliable infrastructure, automate deployments, and improve development workflows through modern DevOps practices.

